  "releaseNotes": "2.0.1\n\nBreaking Changes\n\n- `ISimpleMultiMap.Clear(TKey)` removed — was deprecated in v1.0.12 as an alias for `RemoveKey(TKey)`. Use `RemoveKey(key)` instead\n- `ISimpleMultiMap.Flatten()` removed — was deprecated in v1.0.12. Enumerate the map directly with `foreach`, `ToList()`, or LINQ instead\n\nSee full Release Notes history: https://github.com/TigoS/MultiMap/blob/master/ReleaseNotes.md",
